flowchart TD
    A[Risk signal, user block/report or provider alert] --> B[Immediate scoped protection where needed]
    B --> C[Create purpose-limited case and preserve minimum evidence]
    C --> D[Severity, language, country and conflict triage]
    D --> E{Imminent or high-impact risk?}
    E -->|Yes| F[Qualified urgent human review and temporary restriction]
    E -->|No| G[Standard bounded review]
    F --> H[Evidence-based proportionate decision]
    G --> H
    H --> I[Notify safely with reason, duration and appeal route]
    I --> J{Appeal?}
    J -->|Yes| K[Independent review including shared device/contact/network context]
    K --> L[Uphold, narrow, reverse or remediate]
    J -->|No| M[Expiry/review and recurrence monitoring]
    L --> M
    M --> N[Quality, fairness and policy improvement]
